# ── Proto-Blocks site-builder ────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# .protoblocks/ holds both the build state and its working files. The state is
# worth keeping: build.json is the resumable plan for every page, and
# tokens.json is the input that regenerates tailwind-theme.css and the
# theme.json palette, so losing it means re-deriving the brand by hand.
#
# artifacts/ is the opposite — design frames, section crops, per-iteration
# renders and QA composites. All of it regenerates from the design and the
# build, and it reached 25 MB on the Products page alone.
.protoblocks/artifacts/
.protoblocks/*.bak
